%% Sfumato v0.2 edit sequence
%% Status: Implemented workflow; facade and renderer boundaries remain transitional.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as CLI, TUI, or library client
    participant App as EditSlides workflow
    participant Config as EffectiveConfig resolver
    participant Store as ArtifactStore port
    participant Deck as SlideDeckDocument [Implemented]
    participant Prompt as PromptCatalog port
    participant Model as TextProvider [Implemented trait]
    participant Render as Render ports [Implemented behavior]
    participant Tx as ArtifactTransaction port

    Client->>App: edit(request, operation_context)
    App->>Config: resolve project and text model
    Config-->>App: ConfigSnapshot
    App->>Store: read generated Markdown inside project workspace
    Store-->>App: original deck bytes and identity
    App->>Deck: parse, snapshot, and validate
    Deck-->>App: revision-guarded ReviewSnapshot
    App->>Prompt: render(edit PromptPair, variables)
    App->>Model: generate_text(prompt, cancellation)
    alt provider limit
        App->>Prompt: render(compact edit PromptPair, variables)
        App->>Model: generate compact patch
    end
    Model-->>App: RFC 6902 patch
    App->>Deck: allow only tests and slide Markdown replacements
    alt invalid response on first attempt
        App->>Prompt: render(edit pair with corrective variables)
        App->>Model: generate corrected patch
        Model-->>App: corrected patch
        App->>Deck: apply and validate
    else valid response
        Deck-->>App: candidate and PatchReport
    end
    App->>Render: inspect layout and render diagrams
    App->>Tx: begin immutable child revision
    App->>Render: render candidate PDF into staging
    Render-->>Tx: staged Markdown, PDF, theme, and diagrams
    App->>Tx: validate manifest and atomically commit revision
    Tx-->>App: committed artifact receipts
    App-->>Client: EditSlidesResult

    Note over Deck,Model: Title slide, frontmatter, IDs, order, and unrelated content remain protected.
    Note over Store,Tx: Staging is rolled back on failure. A successful commit renames the complete immutable revision and atomically updates current.json.
